{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2b35cc6a-c8a3-82fb-8f04-d6ff45621554",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T11:04:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ileana Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:02:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:02:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I'm calling about trash. I have an old appliance I need hauled away. Can you hear me okay? I've got one bar here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:02:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you, just a little choppy. Go ahead. What kind of appliance is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:02:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A washing machine. It's [line breaks up] been in the garage for years. I want it gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:02:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a washing machine. Sorry, you cut out for a second there. Did you say it's in the garage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:02:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the garage. I can bring it to the curb. I just don't know if the regular truck takes it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:02:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me get your address so I can look at your pickup day. What is the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:02:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "273 Bellevue Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:02:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "273 Bellevue Avenue, in the Bellevue area. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:02:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:02:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Give me one moment, I'm going to pull that up. Can I put you on a short hold?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:03:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I'll be here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:03:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:03:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for waiting, Ms.... I'm sorry, I didn't get your name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:03:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Castillo. And that hold music, it was actually nice. I wasn't expecting that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:03:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, well, I'll pass that along. Okay, Ms. Castillo, so for 273 Bellevue, your trash pickup is Thursday, so tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow. Okay. And the washing machine, can I put it out tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:03:34-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not with the regular trash, no. Large appliances like that usually need a separate bulk pickup that gets scheduled ahead of time. Some of them also need to have certain parts removed first, depending on what it is. I can have somebody from our office call you with the details on the scheduling. Do you want that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:03:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Somebody has to call me back, I guess. It's always like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:04:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry for the runaround. Let me take your number. What's the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:04:06-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0174."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:04:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0174. I'll note it's a washing machine from the garage at 273 Bellevue Avenue, and you'd like to schedule a bulk pickup. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:04:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:04:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And your next regular pickup is tomorrow, Thursday, for your normal trash. Keep the washing machine in the garage until you hear from us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:04:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. When will they call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:04:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually within a day or two. If it's a few days and you haven't heard anything, call back and ask for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:04:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:04:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Castillo. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
